<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>灵梦 · 嗯嗯体操</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#eae7de;color:#393540;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{height:100dvh;min-height:680px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:24px 32px}header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}h1{font-size:25px;margin:7px 0 8px}p{font-size:13px;color:#71695e;margin:0;line-height:1.8}.badge{font:11px monospace;color:#817260;letter-spacing:.12em}#stage{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:300px}canvas{width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;touch-action:none;cursor:grab}canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}.shadow{position:absolute;width:27%;height:5%;background:#67543b;opacity:.13;filter:blur(16px);border-radius:50%;left:36.5%;bottom:8%}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}button,a{font:13px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#524a41;border:1px solid #cfc7ba;border-radius:8px;background:#f5f1e8;padding:9px 14px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}button:hover,a:hover{background:#fffaf0}button.active{background:#7d3c3d;color:#fff7e6;border-color:#7d3c3d}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}#error{position:absolute;inset:10%;text-align:center}#error img{max-width:100%;max-height:80%}#phase{width:230px;max-width:55vw;accent-color:#8d4042}#phase-label{position:absolute;top:12px;left:0;font-size:13px;color:#87534e;pointer-events:none}#travel{display:none}#time-label{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:12px;color:#71695e}label{font-size:13px;color:#71695e;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}footer div{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}@media(max-width:650px){main{padding:16px;min-height:920px}header{display:block}header p{margin-top:8px}footer{display:block}footer p{margin-bottom:10px}h1{font-size:22px}#stage{min-height:320px}.controls{gap:6px}button,a{padding:8px 11px}}
</style>
<main><header><div><div class="badge">YUKKURI / REIMU IN MOTION</div><h1>灵梦 · 嗯嗯体操</h1><p>转向抬臀 → 上下伸缩 → 左右侧弯 → 回正</p></div><p>沿用魔理沙体操节奏<br>拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击复位</p></header>
<div id="stage"><div class="shadow"></div><canvas id="view" aria-label="灵梦嗯嗯体操三维动画"></canvas><div id="phase-label" aria-live="off"></div><div id="error"><p id="status" role="status">正在加载动画，先显示静态预览。</p><img src="__FALLBACK_IMAGE__" alt="灵梦基础模型"></div></div>
<div class="controls"><button data-clip="taiso" class="active" aria-pressed="true">嗯嗯整套</button><button data-clip="press" aria-pressed="false">抬臀用力</button><button data-clip="exercise_vertical" aria-pressed="false">上下体操</button><button data-clip="exercise_sides" aria-pressed="false">左右体操</button><button data-clip="stretch" aria-pressed="false">单次伸长</button></div>
<div class="controls"><button id="walk" class="active" aria-pressed="true">暂停动作</button><button id="rest">静止造型</button><button id="travel" aria-pressed="false" disabled>前进演示</button><label>进度 <input id="phase" type="range" min="0" max="14" step="0.01" value="0" aria-label="动作进度"></label><span id="time-label"></span></div>
<div class="controls"><button data-angle="0">正面</button><button data-angle="-32">四分之三</button><button data-angle="90">侧面</button><button data-angle="180">背面</button><button id="auto" aria-pressed="false">自动旋转</button><button id="reset">复位</button></div>
<footer><p>14 秒连续演示 · 上下 2.62 秒 / 左右 2.36 秒<br>八景 U 动作适配；尚未接入 MC 实体。</p><div><a href="reimu.bbmodel" download>含动画模型</a><a href="reimu.animation.json" download>动画 JSON</a><a href="../reimu-hakkei/preview.html">基础造型</a></div></footer></main>
